{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n沈金だよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送は先週で最後で\n今日は録音になるんですが\n是非、聴いてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/30/6009039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21時からFM FUJIだよ！\nお忘れなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷TSUTAYAで\nまた乃木展やってるみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/30/6009039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう結構前からやってるから\nみんな観に行ったのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの写真だから\n中田も何枚か載ってるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブランコ、クリスマスメドレー、乃木團\nなどいい感じの写真たくさんあるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って友達が言ってた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/30/6009039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷TSUTAYAとかみんな行くから\n乃木展やる度に友達何人かから\n観たよ報告来ますもんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだの方は是非、観に行ってきてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週なので\nもう観た方もたくさんいると思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部＃30』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップされてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、この回をもって\n最終回となります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/30/6009039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},